      "text": {
        "zh_TW": "武師：「我追灰面具時，把磨刀石掉在塔裡了，大概在四層。幫我找回來，我給你點好東西。」",
        "en": "Weapon master: \"I lost my whetstone in the tower chasing the grey masks. The fourth floor, I think. Bring it back and I'll give you something good.\""
      },
